<title>USA: Diablo Canyon 1,073 MW nuke still down for work.</title>
<headline>Diablo Canyon 1,073 MW nuke still down for work.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Gas &amp; Electric Co's 1,073 megawatt (MW) Diablo Canyon unit 2 was still off-line for maintenance work after tripping on Saturday when a feedwater pump line malfunctioned, a company spokesman said Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said further information on the plant's status would be made available on a &quot;day by day basis.&quot;</p>
<p>The spokesman said Tuesday the plant would be down for days rather than weeks.</p>
<p>Diablo Canyon's 1,087 MW unit 1 is scheduled to shut for regular refueling on April 19.</p>
<p>--Los Angeles bureau + 1 213 955 6761</p>
